    rdf:value """Saturday, June 22, 1907
Ray and Ellie.
Typewrote Bernhard’s article on Girolamo di Giovanni.
Swam in the afternoon with the usual party. Delicious!
The Countess Serristori and Rembelinski came to dine and stayed till midnight, each so eager to talk about their own development and history they would scarcely listen to each other!"""^^xsd:string ;
    mbdiaries-ontology:index 195 ;
